{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join SAAL at the beginning of their journey in 'The Search for Above Average Life,' a narrative-driven bullet hell about finding friends. You'll scan the galaxy searching for above-average life. Dodge red bullets and collect green bullets to overcome the language barrier. Meet and befriend quirky aliens. Will you help SAAL make friends?<br><br>This Demo features five unique alien encounter each with their own distinct personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five below average planets that inject the game with lore and humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One boss fight unlocked after befriending five characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard and Mouse Support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Enjoy the demo.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987300?t=1756408110","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987300?t=1756408110","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987300/20ccfc60856988460dca8ca0d876e9134de63198/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756408110","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987300/20ccfc60856988460dca8ca0d876e9134de63198/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756408110","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join SAAL at the beginning of their journey in 'The Search for Above Average Life,' a narrative-driven bullet hell about finding friends. You'll scan the galaxy searching for above-average life. Dodge red bullets and collect green bullets to overcome the language barrier. Meet and befriend quirky al